msgstr "Xahau"

#: includes/admin/class-ledger-direct-admin.php:61
msgid "Accept XAH on Xahau"
msgstr "Aceptar XAH en Xahau"

#: includes/admin/class-ledger-direct-admin.php:62
msgid "Xahau is a network of its own that speaks the XRP Ledger's protocol: payments in XAH, by destination tag, to an account of the same form. Use an account that receives on Xahau alone, not one that also receives on the XRP Ledger."
msgstr "Xahau es una red propia que usa el protocolo del XRP Ledger: pagos en XAH, por destination tag, a una cuenta del mismo formato. Use una cuenta que reciba solo en Xahau, no una que también reciba en el XRP Ledger."

#: includes/admin/class-ledger-direct-admin.php:67
msgid "Xahau Network"
msgstr "Red Xahau"

#: includes/admin/class-ledger-direct-admin.php:68
msgid "Choose the Xahau network"
msgstr "Elija la red Xahau"

#: includes/admin/class-ledger-direct-admin.php:78
msgid "Xahau Account - MAINNET"
msgstr "Cuenta Xahau – MAINNET"

#: includes/admin/class-ledger-direct-admin.php:80
